void main() {
  %order%('Test add function', () {
    int result = add(2, 3);
    %order%(result, equals(5));
  });
}
```

What will this test output if the add function works correctly?

```dart
import 'package:test/test.dart';

int add(int a, int b) {
  return a + b;
}

void main() {
  test('Test add function', () {
    int result = add(3, 4);
    expect(result, equals(7));
  });
}
```

